\section{Conclusion}
\label{sec:conclusion}

We measure $\Kempirical{=}2$ for web text (8/9 configurations), $\Kempirical{=}1$--$2$ for code, and $\Kempirical{=}3$ for arXiv; generator-independent features ($\rho > 0.90$) validate binary filtering.

